{"id":"mysl_","lemma":"мысль","pos":"noun","rank":596,"glosses":["thought","idea"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/13/Ru-%D0%BC%D1%8B%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D1%8B%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"мысли","plural":"мысли"},"examples":[{"text":"Я потерял мысль.","en":"I lost my train of thought.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"потерять"},null]},{"text":"Я думаю, это хорошая мысль.","en":"I think that's a good idea.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null]},{"text":"Я не уверен, что это хорошая мысль.","en":"I'm not sure that's a good idea.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null,null,null,{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]},{"text":"Том отбросил эту мысль.","en":"Tom pushed that thought aside.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null,null]},{"text":"У меня есть одна мысль.","en":"I have one thought in mind.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,null]}]}